id: frozen-in-time
name: Frozen in Time
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: another Character's Frozen Turn, on everyone it holds for as long as it lasts (chat.mjs
# postTimeFreeze, endFrozenTurn). No Counter, Instant or Out-of-Sequence Maneuvers but Surges: refused where those are.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Time is frozen: Defense Value 2(bT) lower, Perception 2 lower, and no Counter, Instant or Out-of-Sequence Maneuvers.
text: >
  Frozen in Time: "During a Frozen Turn, other Characters cannot use Counter Maneuvers, Instant Maneuvers, or
  Out-of-Sequence Maneuvers (except Surges). Additionally, their Defense Value is reduced by 2(bT) and their Perception
  Skill Bonus is reduced by 2."

---

[passive]
defenseValue -= 2(bT);
skill.perception.bonus -= 2;
